{
  "entries": [
    {
      "offset": "0x22699e",
      "back_en": "Know your place.",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Equivalente."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x2269af",
      "back_en": "Cease your impertinence. Do you not see this",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Tom arcaico mantido."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x226c14",
      "back_en": "Oh me... In truth, I was not expecting a Tatari",
      "verdict": "revise",
      "note": "'O me' é exclamação ('ai de mim'); 'Ó eu' soa literal/estranho."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x226cc1",
      "back_en": "A person... changed into a Tatari...",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Fiel."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x226e16",
      "back_en": "Tatari... Kuon, do you know anything about it?",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Equivalente."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x226e4b",
      "back_en": "Y-Yes, in truth! Lady Kuon, your dark gaze",
      "verdict": "revise",
      "note": "'thy grimlike reactions' vira 'olhar sombrio' e segue como 'dela' (3ª pessoa) na próxima linha; quebra a 2ª pessoa."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x226e76",
      "back_en": "her reactions revealed some knowledge of these Tatari.",
      "verdict": "revise",
      "note": "Voz muda para 3ª pessoa ('dela'); original 'thy' é 2ª pessoa."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x226ea4",
      "back_en": "Of those cursed creatures, little is what we know.",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Sentido preservado."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x226ed8",
      "back_en": "If you have something to share, speak — it will surely be",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Adequado."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x226f09",
      "back_en": "benefit.",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "'boon' como 'benefício' ok."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x226f1c",
      "back_en": "That's... something I can't do.",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Fiel."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x227082",
      "back_en": "Taboo? Hmm, dear lady... I know that few",
      "verdict": "revise",
      "note": "'dear sister' traduzido 'querida senhora', inconsistente com 'cara irmã' usado depois."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x2270b3",
      "back_en": "wish to study them, but I know of no such prohibition.",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Antecipa 'taboo'; leve redundância com próxima linha, aceitável."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x2270e6",
      "back_en": "taboo...",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Fiel."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x2270ef",
      "back_en": "It's true. Few dare to enter the sinister depths",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Equivalente."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x227149",
      "back_en": "Thus, those who aim to study the creatures are",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "'fiends'→'criaturas' aceitável."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x22718e",
      "back_en": "But this is truly intriguing.",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Fiel."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x2271c3",
      "back_en": "Please, dear lady. Is there some reason why",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Adequado."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x2271f3",
      "back_en": "why you will not tell us?",
      "verdict": "revise",
      "note": "Redundância 'pelo qual ... por que' ao juntar com a linha anterior."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x22723a",
      "back_en": "that we shouldn't have seen.",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Fiel."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x227257",
      "back_en": "Something we... shouldn't have seen?",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Fiel."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x2272b2",
      "back_en": "Otherwise...?",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Equivalente."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x2272c0",
      "back_en": "Maybe you'll have to \"disappear.\"",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Sentido preservado."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x2274a3",
      "back_en": "Ah, the reason she cannot explain it is precisely",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Fiel."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x2276b5",
      "back_en": "transformation into a Tatari.",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Fiel."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x2279b7",
      "back_en": "lengths...?",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "'extremos' adequado."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x227b13",
      "back_en": "was once a person?",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Aceitável apesar de ordem invertida."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x227c24",
      "back_en": "The one that came out of that casket?",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Fiel."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x227cf6",
      "back_en": "Ah!? Dear sister... you can't be suggesting--",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "'cara irmã' correto."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x227d81",
      "back_en": "Tatari...",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Idêntico."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x227d8b",
      "back_en": "I believe... he was a being from our myths.",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Fiel."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x227de3",
      "back_en": "ruled our world.",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Equivalente."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x227e26",
      "back_en": "The Utawarerumono themselves.",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Mantido."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x227e44",
      "back_en": "The Onvitaikayan...",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Mantido."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x227e58",
      "back_en": "Gh...!?",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Idêntico."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x227f2b",
      "back_en": "was once a human being...?",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "'pessoa' para 'human being' aceitável."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x227f84",
      "back_en": "Countless images blur my mind. I feel",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Fiel."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x227fb3",
      "back_en": "that I'm slipping away. Suddenly everyone",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Equivalente."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x228067",
      "back_en": "it makes a lot of sense with all this.",
      "verdict": "revise",
      "note": "Omite 'it's true' (condição/afirmação) do original."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x228099",
      "back_en": "If the truth is that... those we worship,",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Fiel."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x2280c9",
      "back_en": "the Onvitaikayan, are what the Tatari truly are...",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Fiel."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x228147",
      "back_en": "Well, well... Yes, all this seems a bit heavier",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Sotaque estilizado ('Shim','isho') intencional."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x22833f",
      "back_en": "O lamentable, that I must forgo such rare",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Estilizado mantido."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x228399",
      "back_en": "But o'conscience, I promise thee that",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Estilizado mantido."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x22859c",
      "back_en": "I suppose... yes?",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Sentido preservado."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x22866c",
      "back_en": "Huh...? Haku?",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Equivalente."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x2286f0",
      "back_en": "M-Master Haku, is something wrong...?",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Estilizado 'Meshtre' intencional."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x228721",
      "back_en": "Boss, what's wrong...!? Hey, boss!",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Fiel."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x22874d",
      "back_en": "Gh... AAAGGGHHH!!",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Equivalente."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x22876a",
      "back_en": "Master!!",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Fiel."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x22878e",
      "back_en": "Is this the Tatari's curse...?",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Fiel."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x2288da",
      "back_en": "Master Haku!!",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Fiel."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x2288e8",
      "back_en": "Ha... ku...?",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Idêntico."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x22672c",
      "back_en": "I can manage.",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Sentido preservado."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x22685a",
      "back_en": "This thing's full of Tatari! If we don't act soon,",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "'hurry'→'agirmos logo' aceitável."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x226928",
      "back_en": "The twins seem to understand and quickly",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Fiel."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x22698a",
      "back_en": "shake their heads.",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Inferido corretamente do contexto."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x2269de",
      "back_en": "emblem?",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "'brasão' adequado."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x22757c",
      "back_en": "like that?",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Equivalente."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x227cad",
      "back_en": "What are you talking about? Isn't that exactly",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Fiel."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x227fe2",
      "back_en": "sounds so distant.",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Fiel."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x228633",
      "back_en": "Sir Haku...? You're looking somewhat pale...",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "'Sir' mantido, aceitável."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x228662",
      "back_en": "Sir Haku?",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Idêntico."
    }
  ],
  "reviewed": 63
}